# doc/trm/assets/.gitignore
#
# The Makefile copies HW images from hw/*/doc/assets/ into this directory
# for the PDF build (imagesdir = assets). Those copies are ignored by the
# blanket "doc/*/assets/*" rule in the root .gitignore.
#
# Hand-authored documentation images placed directly here ARE tracked.
# Convention: prefix them with "ocah" so they are picked up automatically.
# Non-conforming names can be added as one-off exceptions below.

# --- Naming-convention patterns (no editing needed for new images) ---
!ocah-*.png
!ocah_*.png
!ocah-*.svg
!ocah_*.svg

# --- One-off exceptions ---
!self-test-*.png
!bus_err_unit.png
!TT_Cover_Image.png
!oca-banner.png
